Weather uses these works by other people.

Data, fetched when the app runs and not stored in this repository:

Forecast     MET Norway Locationforecast (https://api.met.no), CC BY 4.0 and
             NLOD 2.0: "Data from MET Norway". Through this site's
             /api/forecast, which converts units and MET's weather symbols to
             the app's icons and sums the hours into days.
US extras    National Weather Service (https://www.weather.gov), open data:
             rain chances, gusts and the time zone for US places.
Aurora       NOAA Space Weather Prediction Center Kp forecast
             (https://www.swpc.noaa.gov), public domain.
Place search Photon by komoot (https://photon.komoot.io), with data from
             OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), credited in the place picker.
             Time zones for found places come from the tz database's zone.tab
             (public domain), in ../_shared/timezones.js.

None of these sources endorses this app.
